BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 784 Tm (PAGE 2 / 4 - SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 751 Tm (Controlled test document - text selectable, 4 pages) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 715 Tm (The platform has three layers: user interface, API, and database.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 679 Tm (The React user interface displays reports and lets staff manage records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 643 Tm (The FastAPI service processes HTTP requests and business rules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 607 Tm (PostgreSQL stores customers, orders, products, and inventory entries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 571 Tm (Customer and order records are connected using customer_id.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 535 Tm (JWT tokens are used to authenticate registered users.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 499 Tm (Redis is NOT used in the current architecture.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 463 Tm (No application-level response cache has been implemented yet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 427 Tm (Reports are requested through authenticated API endpoints.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 391 Tm (The platform does not currently offer a public developer API.) Tj ET
endstream
