BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 751 Tm (Controlled test document - text selectable, 4 pages) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 715 Tm (The target API response time is less than 200 milliseconds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 679 Tm (The platform is designed for 150 concurrent active users.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 643 Tm (Authentication uses JSON Web Tokens \(JWT\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 607 Tm (Passwords are never stored in plain text.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 571 Tm (Database backups run every day at 02:30 UTC.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 535 Tm (Database backup copies are retained for 14 days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 499 Tm (Backup access is restricted to the operations team.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 463 Tm (Users can view only the records allowed by their permissions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 427 Tm (An audit log records important administrative changes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45 391 Tm (Performance and availability figures are design targets, not test results.) Tj ET
